This is a stub repository. It documents projects whose implementations are not
published. Nothing in this license grants rights to any unpublished source, and no
representation is made that such source will be released.

Detection content -- signature rules, hunt logic and behavioural indicators -- is
provided under the same terms and may be freely adapted into your own detection
pipeline without attribution if you prefer.

